enigma2icons icon font (TiviAtv-FHD/TiviAtv-icons.ttf)
  Copy of enigma2icons.ttf from openATV enigma2 (data/fonts), made with
  fontello. Part of openATV, licensed under the GNU General Public License
  version 2. Shipped unchanged so that openATV 7.x and Egami, which do not
  have this font, can show the skin's icons; openATV 8 uses its own copy.
  https://github.com/openatv/enigma2/tree/master/data/fonts

Channel logos (picons) are NOT included in this repository.
They are installed separately under /usr/share/enigma2/picon/.
